{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_240_beast_bird_horse_ev_talk.txt/8": "这匹马温顺又可爱，\r\n要好好待它。\r\n好了，去和新主人亲近亲近吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_240_beast_bird_horse_ev_talk.txt/9": "买下了驮马！\r\n可以把物品交给\r\n跟在身后的马保管！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_darkness.txt/0": "呀啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_find.txt/0": "（哎呀，你露出的肌肤\r\n比我还多呢～）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_find.txt/1": "哎呀，要保存记忆吗～？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_find.txt/2": "好呀，出发前要保存吗？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/36": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/102": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/172": "购买记忆宝石",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/214": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/0": "是客人吗～？\r\n你好呀。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/1": "只要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]～\r\n我就替你保存记忆～。\r\n怎么样呀？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/2": "哎呀，不需要吗～？\r\n明白了。\r\n有需要时再来吧～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/3": "好～谢谢惠顾～。\r\n那么，一路小心～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/4": "好呀！\r\n……哎呀呀，你的钱不够呢。\r\n嗯……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/5": "……好吧～。\r\n只付现有的钱也可以～。\r\n这是特别优待哦～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/6": "那么那么，就把你的记忆\r\n满满地刻在我心里吧～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_talk.txt/7": "……呼，结束了呢～。\r\n非常感谢～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_241_mermaid_save_ev_wanted.txt/0": "呀啊啊，是罪人！\r\n谁来一下～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_find.txt/0": "牛排，要不要来份牛排——！\r\n一份管饱的大牛排！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/0": "刚才多谢了。\r\n抱歉，今天食材用完了。\r\n下次再来啊！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/192": "超大牛排_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]（EN+200%）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/271": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/1": "欢迎，客人！\r\n本店招牌就是分量十足的牛排，\r\n一整块！怎么样！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/2": "……嗯，客人，\r\n你的钱好像不太够！\r\n抱歉，下次再来吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/3": "好，\r\n给你上一份刚做好的！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/4": "……好了，出炉！\r\n热腾腾，肉汁直流！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/5": "分量十足的牛排！\r\n好吃！肚子都撑满了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/6": "怎么样，本店的牛排？\r\n会上瘾吧？\r\n下次再来啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_242_beast_cook_ev_talk.txt/7": "这样啊，\r\n肚子饿了再来吧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_243_beast_medic_ev_find.txt/0": "旅人，需要药品吗……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_243_beast_medic_ev_talk.txt/0": "我在卖药。\r\n旅人，有什么需要吗……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_243_beast_medic_ev_talk.txt/1": "非常感谢。\r\n如果愿意，请再来……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/0": "抱歉，今天已经打烊了。\r\n若有缘，请再来找我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/1": "你好，我是装备调整师。\r\n你有没有用矮人先生的卷轴等活动\r\n做过应急修理的武具？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/2": "带有“临时”标记的武具，\r\n耐久度会很快下降。\r\n我可以把它恢复如初。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/585": "去除装备中武器的“临时”标记[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/668": "去除装备中武器的“临时”标记[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/847": "去除装备中防具的“临时”标记[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/929": "去除装备中防具的“临时”标记[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/3": "……你现在的装备上，\r\n似乎没有“临时”标记。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/4": "如果随身物品中有\r\n带有“临时”标记的武具，\r\n请先装备上再来找我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/5": "我可以清除一件武具上的\r\n所有“临时”标记。\r\n旅人，你需要我吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/6": "不需要我的力量吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/7": "实在非常难以启齿……\r\n你的钱似乎不够。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/8": "明白了。\r\n我会让你的<weapon>\r\n恢复原状。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/9": "请稍候。\r\n迅速、细致、恢复如初……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/10": "武器已调整完成！\r\n“临时”标记已去除！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/11": "明白了。\r\n我会让你的<armor>\r\n恢复原状。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/12": "请稍候。\r\n迅速、细致、恢复如初……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/13": "防具已调整完成！\r\n“临时”标记已去除！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/14": "怎么样？\r\n这样一来，耐久度也不会\r\n再快速下降了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_talk.txt/15": "装备很重要，\r\n请让它们能陪伴你更久。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_244_beast_maintenance_ev_wanted.txt/0": "无论人类还是野兽，\r\n都有绝不能打破的\r\n规矩……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_245_criminal_equip_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "哼，一个毫无前科的安分人\r\n跑来这座城做什么？\r\n我可没东西卖给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_245_criminal_equip_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "你被人扒光了？\r\n原来只是个受害者啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_245_criminal_equip_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "嘿，兄弟，过得怎样？\r\n我这儿有好装备。\r\n不过嘛，该付的钱还是得付。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_245_criminal_equip_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "那么回头见，兄弟。\r\n咱们都厚着脸皮活下去吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_245_criminal_equip_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "……别怪我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_246_criminal_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "一个没犯过罪的家伙，\r\n来这里做什么？\r\n趁早滚出去吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_246_criminal_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "……吓我一跳，你这不是正忙着\r\n一路犯罪吗？\r\n嗯？不是吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_246_criminal_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "别看这样，我也在开道具店。\r\n要看看吗？\r\n我可不卖什么来路不明的东西。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_246_criminal_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "你也不容易，\r\n好好想办法挺过去吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_246_criminal_item_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "若是背负罪孽踏上旅途，\r\n就该做好被追猎的觉悟吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_darkness.txt/0": "啊，不要……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_find.txt/0": "（公然猥亵的罪人……？）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_find.txt/1": "要保存……游戏吗？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/217": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/283": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/353": "购买记忆宝石",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/395": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/0": "……你很清白。\r\n在这座城里，就是异类。\r\n所以……保存要收\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/1": "……你是罪人。\r\n在这座城里，很普通。\r\n所以……保存要收\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/2": "……这样啊。\r\n也没关系。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/3": "……请吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/4": "……那就开始吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/5": "……你的钱不够。\r\n不过，嗯，好吧。\r\n就收下这些全部，替你保存。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_talk.txt/6": "……结束了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_247_criminal_save_ev_wanted.txt/0": "……坏人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_249_scroll_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎来到神秘卷轴店。\r\n卷轴一定能在旅途中\r\n帮上你的忙。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_249_scroll_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "谢谢你来看。\r\n请务必再来哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_249_scroll_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "有坏人的气味呢……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/0": "（光是看着都替人害臊……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/1": "你、你还在这里？\r\n差不多该走了吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/2": "再次感谢！\r\n下次也请多关照～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/3": "………。\r\n（……你不会觉得害臊吗？）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/4": "！敌人！？\r\n……你不攻击吗？\r\n客人？真的？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/5": "你好！\r\n我是旅行料理人。\r\n你肚子不饿吗？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/1314": "元气套餐_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]（EN+$tmp2%）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/1437": "生命套餐_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]（HP+$tmp2/EN+$tmp3%）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/1504": "取消",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/6": "你没带钱吧？\r\n果然不是客人……\r\n快、快离远一点。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/7": "你的钱好像不够。\r\n抱歉，攒够钱再来吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/8": "元气套餐，是吧……\r\n好，请用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/9": "好，元气套餐一份！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/10": "……来！请慢用！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/11": "元气满满！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/12": "招待不周！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/13": "你没带钱吧？\r\n果然不是客人……\r\n快、快离远一点。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/14": "你的钱好像不够。\r\n抱歉，攒够钱再来吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/15": "生命套餐，是吧……\r\n好，请用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/16": "好，生命套餐一份！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/17": "好，完成，这是我的全力之作！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/18": "好吃！\r\n身体得到治疗，元气也恢复了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/19": "招待不周！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/20": "……这样啊……那么，快离远一点。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_24_travel_cook_ev_talk.txt/21": "这样啊～原来不饿吗？\r\n下次也请多关照～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_252_cave_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "你可以在这里休息。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_252_cave_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎，请进。\r\n这里是为洞窟探索者\r\n设立的休息处。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_252_cave_guard_ev_talk.txt/1": "我负责管理物资。\r\n如果有需要什么，\r\n请告诉我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_253_pick_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "你要不要来把鹤嘴锄？\r\n挖洞最合适了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_253_pick_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "要好好干啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_253_pick_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "距离这座大洞窟的出口\r\n还有\\c[52]$tmp1km\\c[0]。\r\n别泄气啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/0": "今天差不多该打烊了。\r\n下次再见！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/166": "让你恢复精神（HP+100，EN+70%）_$tmp1拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/227": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/1": "你好！\r\n别看我这样，其实也是治疗师。\r\n不过还只是见习的……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/2": "不过我能让你恢复健康！\r\n因为我是见习生，只收$tmp1拉比斯。\r\n怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/3": "谢谢！\r\n那么，我来让你恢复精神！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/4": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]恢复了一些健康！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_254_healer_ev_talk.txt/5": "这样啊……\r\n等我独当一面后，\r\n到时可要再来找我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_255_beast_cave_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "辛苦了，旅人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_255_beast_cave_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "探索洞窟很辛苦吧？\r\n能休息就尽量多休息。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_255_beast_cave_guard_ev_talk.txt/1": "需要什么吗？\r\n这里有的东西，\r\n我可以分给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_258_mermaid_ev_talk.txt/0": "人类客人？\r\n欢迎来到我们的村落。\r\n你能来到这里，真不容易。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_258_mermaid_ev_talk.txt/1": "既然你是客人，\r\n我就让你稍微恢复些精神。\r\n不收钱，放心吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_259_mermaid_weed_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "好呀，旅人，需要海草吗？\r\n可以用你那些闪亮的石头\r\n来交换哦！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_259_mermaid_weed_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "好呀，多谢多谢，\r\n下次再来哦～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_find.txt/0": "（来了个怪人！！！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_find.txt/1": "有想鉴定的商品吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/0": "今天已经鉴定过了吧？\r\n非常感谢。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/203": "委托鉴定_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/261": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/1": "（怪人往这边来了！）\r\n欢、欢迎光临。我是鉴定师。\r\n鉴定需要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]。\r\n要进行鉴定吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/2": "我是鉴定师。\r\n只要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，\r\n就能为你完全鉴定所有物品。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/3": "你的钱不够！\r\n实在太遗憾了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/4": "好，那么开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/5": "所有物品都已鉴定完成！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/6": "对你有帮助吗？\r\n非常感谢。\r\n（平安结束了……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/7": "对你有帮助吗？\r\n非常感谢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_25_connoisseur_ev_talk.txt/8": "真遗憾！\r\n那么下次有机会再说吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_260_mermaid_recycle_ev_find.txt/0": "嘿！垃圾，这里有垃圾哦～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_260_mermaid_recycle_ev_talk.txt/0": "回收利用！这可是最前沿的生意！\r\n那就是我的工作～！\r\n海里有掉落的垃圾哦～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_260_mermaid_recycle_ev_talk.txt/1": "怎么样，垃圾是不是最棒！\r\n耶呼～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_261_mermaid_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "你这个人。\r\n来这个村落有何目的？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_261_mermaid_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "这里是人鱼的村落，人鱼的安息之地。\r\n我不知道你为何而来，\r\n若敢作恶，我绝不留情。记住。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_266_imprison_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "你愿意帮我？\r\n真的吗？\r\n谢、谢谢你！真是太感谢了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_266_imprison_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "让我聊表谢意。\r\n还有，明明已经受你帮助，\r\n还要再拜托你，实在过意不去……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_266_imprison_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "哦，你愿意听？抱歉。\r\n希望你能带我离开这座要塞地带。\r\n当然，我会再另外酬谢你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_266_imprison_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "我会跟着你。\r\n看来你是位出色的战士，\r\n我可以依靠你。"
}
